              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Yesu aja i Nazareti aho yakuriye. Ku musi w’Isabato, yinjira mw’isinagogi nk’uko yari amenyereye, maze ahaguruka ngo asome Ivyanditswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
